# Build context hygiene for the thadam-simulator image. The build runs
# `cargo build --release` fresh inside the image; host artifacts are never
# shipped (and a 100+ GB target/ would otherwise be sent to the daemon).
target/
.git
docs/book/
examples/**/data/
examples/**/secrets/*
# ...except an optional build-stage CA bundle for TLS-intercepting networks.
# The directory itself stays in the context so the Dockerfile COPY always resolves.
!examples/**/secrets/ca.pem
**/.DS_Store
